lane GA controller blue
  Clamp dates -> <Dates left to import?>
  <Dates left to import?>
    -no-> (!Rejected)
    -yes-> Create pending SiteImport
  Create pending SiteImport -> <Another import running?>
  <Another import running?>
    -yes-> (!Rejected)
